@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 7.0 Web Scraping

actor "Admin" as A
participant "System" as S
database "Database" as D

== Trigger Scrape ==

A -> S : Pilih sumber scraping, klik "Trigger Scrape"
S -> D : Baca konfigurasi dari scraping_sources
D --> S : Konfigurasi: baseUrl, scraperType, rateLimit

== Proses Scraping ==

S -> S : Scrape data dari website target
S -> D : Simpan raw data hasil scrape (status: pending)
D --> S : Data tersimpan
S -> D : Catat log scraping
D --> S : Log tersimpan
S --> A : Tampilkan jumlah data hasil scrape

== Publish Data ==

A -> S : Review raw data, klik "Publish"
S -> D : Buat event baru dari data scrape
D --> S : Event baru tersimpan (status: pending)
S -> D : Update status_integrasi = true
D --> S : Status terupdate
S --> A : Tampilkan "Data berhasil dipublish sebagai event"

@enduml
